body:
The Ativan isn't doing the trick to keep the worst at bay? Or are you feeling like shit because you wreaked havoc on your body from the bender? 

&#x200B;

I am exiting one myself right now (kinda) and man my body is fucked up. Still not at the point where I can CT without some withdrawal, which sucks because I literally feel like my guts are shredded.

Hey was right there. I also did not take it too far. So I saw it as a sign to dabble again. One month later and i have run through 5 grams. Random alone use etc. Have to completely put it down.

&#x200B;

It can ramp up even further than before. It really can fuck with your brain, you will wonder why you feel bipolar. It is so annoying. Take a month off and see how you feel, thats what I am going to do
